<title>ITALY: Italy's Stet passes to treasury - Prodi.</title>
<headline>Italy's Stet passes to treasury - Prodi.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian telecoms holding Stet will pass from the hands of state conglomerate IRI to the Treasury with immediate effect, Prime Minister Romano Prodi said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The move, called for by the European Commission, is designed to drastically reduce IRI debts and at the same time prepare the telecom giant for privatisation in 1997.</p>
</text>
